  "details": "<p>The remains of three architectural terraces have been noted here. A long-standing local tradition relates the toponym Valllemara to an unfounded tradition that Caius Marius owned the villa. The lowest terrace measures some 50 meters by its widest point.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
